  box(T('Read the scene','读场景'),T('The channel works, but Mira’s message is blank. Different notes describe its large mark, small marks and direction. No holder has the whole brief. Listen to every note before drawing one crew-made card.','纸槽能用了，米拉的信息卡还是空白。不同便条分别说明大图形、小图案和方向，任何一人都没有完整要求。听完每张便条后，再制作同一张本组信息卡。')),
